WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:06.214
Red Fox went into her den.

2
00:00:06.215 --> 00:00:10.493
"Home, sweet home!" she said.

3
00:00:10.494 --> 00:00:13.325
Red Fox looked around.

4
00:00:13.325 --> 00:00:18.040
She saw a trail of dirty footprints.

5
00:00:18.040 --> 00:00:21.832
Her pretty rug was muddy.

6
00:00:21.833 --> 00:00:39.903
Red Fox gasped. "What a mess!"

7
00:00:39.904 --> 00:00:43.373
Then she spotted Tommy Brock.

8
00:00:43.373 --> 00:00:49.931
The badger was asleep—in her bed!

9
00:00:49.931 --> 00:00:52.855
Red Fox was angry.

10
00:00:52.855 --> 00:00:56.772
"That rotten badger!" she thought.

11
00:00:56.772 --> 00:01:00.304
"I must teach him a lesson!"

12
00:01:00.305 --> 00:01:06.335
Red Fox thought of a plan.

13
00:01:06.336 --> 00:01:11.208
She hurried outside.

14
00:01:11.209 --> 00:01:22.567
She filled a bucket with water.

15
00:01:22.568 --> 00:01:29.254
Then Red Fox slipped back into her den.

16
00:01:29.254 --> 00:01:33.724
Tommy was dreaming about his dinner.

17
00:01:33.724 --> 00:01:36.912
"I'll have the bunnies first.

18
00:01:36.913 --> 00:01:41.393
Then I'll eat the eggs and—Hey!"

19
00:01:41.393 --> 00:01:45.722
Splash! Water poured all over Tommy.

20
00:01:45.722 --> 00:01:49.067
"Surprise!" Red Fox cried.

21
00:01:49.068 --> 00:01:52.037
"Huh?" Tommy sat up.

22
00:01:52.038 --> 00:01:55.563
"Get out of my den!" Red Fox yelled.

23
00:01:55.564 --> 00:01:58.875
Tommy jumped out of bed.

24
00:01:58.875 --> 00:02:04.198
He ran and got the eggs.

25
00:02:04.199 --> 00:02:07.887
Flopsy hopped closer to the den.

26
00:02:07.888 --> 00:02:12.424
She peeked inside.

27
00:02:12.425 --> 00:02:14.745
Crack! Splat!

28
00:02:14.746 --> 00:02:19.952
Tommy was throwing eggs at the angry fox!

